75
00:02:09,310 --> 00:02:09,950
So this

76
00:02:09,950 --> 00:02:11,330
concurrency,

77
00:02:11,330 --> 00:02:12,710
is simply about having multiple control flows

78
00:02:12,710 --> 00:02:13,490
that is, multiple tasks

79
00:02:13,490 --> 00:02:14,510
executing at the same time

80
00:02:14,510 --> 00:02:15,870
However,

81
00:02:15,870 --> 00:02:17,350
Now, as for this control flow,

82
00:02:17,350 --> 00:02:19,390
there are actually many different situations.

83
00:02:19,390 --> 00:02:22,910
Let's break concurrency down into the following cases

84
00:02:22,910 --> 00:02:24,610
