106
00:03:08,550 --> 00:03:10,230
Typically,

107
00:03:10,230 --> 00:03:11,430
under a multiprocessor architecture,

108
00:03:11,430 --> 00:03:12,870
memory is generally

109
00:03:12,870 --> 00:03:14,050
still shared.

110
00:03:14,050 --> 00:03:14,710
So,

111
00:03:14,710 --> 00:03:16,550
roughly, that's how it works.

112
00:03:16,550 --> 00:03:18,010
Now, in that case,

113
00:03:18,010 --> 00:03:22,850
this is the most typical multitasking scenario on a multiprocessor.

114
00:03:22,850 --> 00:03:27,030
And there is another scenario,

115
00:03:27,030 --> 00:03:29,930
namely what's called multitasking on a single processor.

116
00:03:29,930 --> 00:03:31,850
This is actually the scenario

117
00:03:31,850 --> 00:03:35,530
on which our operating system development in this course is based,

118
00:03:35,530 --> 00:03:37,570
that is, there is only one processor,

119
00:03:37,570 --> 00:03:40,470
but we still want to, on that single processor,

120
00:03:40,470 --> 00:03:41,850
run multiple control flows at the same time.

121
00:03:41,850 --> 00:03:45,770
So this thing is basically what we did earlier through scheduling,

122
00:03:45,770 --> 00:03:46,930
this kind of multitasking we implemented.

123
00:03:46,930 --> 00:03:50,170
Two tasks go through the scheduler,

124
00:03:50,170 --> 00:03:54,170
meaning that for a while it schedules this one first,

125
00:03:54,170 --> 00:03:55,170
then for a while it schedules that one first.

126
00:03:55,170 --> 00:03:57,190
So they share one processor,

127
00:03:57,190 --> 00:03:58,150
and they share memory.

128
00:03:58,150 --> 00:03:59,550
Now in this situation,

129
00:03:59,550 --> 00:04:02,150
similarly, there are multiple control flows present,

130
00:04:02,150 --> 00:04:04,310
so it can also be considered a form of concurrency.

131
00:04:04,310 --> 00:04:08,150
So besides this first case,

132
00:04:08,150 --> 00:04:09,430
actually there is another one we should talk about,

133
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:11,090
in fact a very typical scenario,

134
00:04:11,090 --> 00:04:14,690
