00:04:26,410 --> 00:04:27,630
So this kind here,

143
00:04:27,630 --> 00:04:28,370
that is to say,

144
00:04:28,370 --> 00:04:32,690
on a single-processor architecture,

145
00:04:32,690 --> 00:04:34,750
a task plus an interrupt,

146
00:04:34,750 --> 00:04:35,710
between these two,

147
00:04:35,710 --> 00:04:37,430
there is actually a state of concurrency as well.

148
00:04:37,430 --> 00:04:39,430
This is also a situation we need to take into account,

149
00:04:39,430 --> 00:04:40,790
when we think about concurrency.

150
00:04:40,790 --> 00:04:43,450
So don't overlook this situation.

