00:04:45,890 --> 00:04:47,330
for concurrency as a whole,

154
00:04:47,330 --> 00:04:49,270
we break it down into three states.

155
00:04:49,270 --> 00:04:52,050
When you think about concurrency issues,

156
00:04:52,050 --> 00:04:53,830
you really have to consider all three of these states.

157
00:04:53,830 --> 00:04:54,630
All of them.

158
00:04:54,630 --> 00:04:58,630
So that's the concept of concurrency.

