So for this kind of instruction sequence,

262
00:08:15,710 --> 00:08:17,270
that's when we pay special attention to it,

263
00:08:17,270 --> 00:08:18,670
and we call it a critical section.

264
00:08:18,670 --> 00:08:24,300
Now, this kind of

