00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:42,260
as our example to explain this to you,

273
00:08:42,260 --> 00:08:43,480
so down below there's a processor,

274
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:46,360
and the blue part up top,

275
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:48,640
you can think of it as a shared resource,

276
00:08:48,640 --> 00:08:52,020
let's say it's a piece of memory,

277
00:08:52,020 --> 00:08:52,660
a variable,

278
00:08:52,660 --> 00:08:54,800
a variable in memory,

279
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:56,060
and on the left,

